Package: gglaplot2
Title: GLA Design Tokens and a ggplot2 Theme
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Micheal", "Slade", , "50627681+Micheal-Slade@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Greater London Authority design tokens as R data, with a
    ggplot2 theme, colour palettes and scales built on them. The successor to
    gglaplot. The tokens are the City Intelligence Unit's visualisation
    team's package, vendored unchanged, so a chart made with this package
    and a dashboard built on the same tokens read as one system.
